security. That's the informal sector.

4
00:00:07.985 --> 00:00:10.210
The anthropologist Keith Hart made

5
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.805
the term informal sector popular,

6
00:00:12.805 --> 00:00:15.018
in a 1973 study of

7
